      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4F1B85DD5740020C8FCC154C11C0020AC10C0ACD569B2C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "생일이신 <U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0001>월 <U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0002>일에\n포켓몬센터를 방문해 주세요!",
